  "gaps": [
    "The capture labels units only as 'credit hours' and does not explicitly state they are semester hours; semester was assumed.",
    "Open electives are 33-45 credit hours; the ledger uses 45 (no concentration). If the optional 12-credit concentration is completed, only 33 elective credit hours are required.",
    "The only concentration listed (Instructional Design and Technology: IDT 2301, IDT 3301, IDT 3302, IDT 3305; 12 credit hours) is optional and 'not currently available for enrollment. Anticipated: July 2026', so it is excluded from the ledger.",
    "The approved course lists for Social and Behavioral Sciences, Natural Sciences, Mathematics, History, and English Composition are not in the capture. Only the Humanities and Fine Arts Group A and Group B lists were captured.",
    "The 'degree program upper-level requirements' referenced for open electives are not stated in the capture.",
    "Residency (institutional credit) requirements, prerequisites, and minimum grade or GPA requirements are not stated in the capture."
  ],
